-- 01_ask_kb_nationwide.sql (ask_nationwide_nov20, 2026-11-20): Ask KB, nationwide rules. NOT APPLIED. Generated by kb_nationwide.py.
-- Adds 56 field chunks (51 state 811 chunks from the app's own state table, 1 general 811 chunk, 4 state-plan chunks)
-- and makes 34 guarded edits to 28 existing chunks (stale app text; chunks the state filter hides).
-- Run in one transaction; expect: insert 56, then 1 row for each update. Run 01_ask_kb_nationwide_test.sql first (it rolls back).
-- A KB rebuild from source must carry kb_nationwide.jsonl and these edits (as with Nov 17-19).

